  (text "ESP32-C3 Super Mini carrier for the BC-250 (serial_led_controller)."
    (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "433d5fcf-f9ae-460f-ac04-fcc8db94a71b")
  )
  (text "The Super Mini brings its own USB-C, 3.3 V regulator, BOOT/RESET buttons and GPIO8 LED."
    (at 20.32 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "85e42cfe-4c51-4951-aa71-14d476e2027a")
  )
  (text "U1 is not soldered: it plugs, pins down, into the 1x8 sockets J12 (left column) and J13 (right), USB-C at the board edge."
    (at 20.32 46.99 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "643bfa6c-07ac-4139-b1f3-e1d93dc0e2f0")
  )
  (text "Its USB VBUS is tied to the 5V pin: cut the red wire in the USB cable (README, Power switch)."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "eed8b0c2-7b40-4c96-8f42-05a58163d994")
  )
  (text "The switch common (J9 pin 4) is a real GND: power_switch.pins.button_gnd is null in the config."
    (at 20.32 31.75 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "6c39be17-9556-4363-9fdc-75db24f94aca")
  )
  (text "Fan header pin 1 = GND, 2 = +12 V, 3 = tach (unused), 4 = PWM. FAN1..4 = GPIO 5, 6, 7, 10 = fans.header1..4."
    (at 20.32 35.56 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "e55824ac-6648-4b8f-819d-b0a1706e585b")
  )
  (text "J1 takes the FSP500-30AS 10-pin Mini-Fit Jr plug; pin map per its pinout drawing (see README)."
    (at 20.32 39.37 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "13111654-51d7-496b-9780-260e7a853519")
  )
  (text "VIN is the strip supply rail (3.3 V from the PSU), separate from 5VSB; the strip path is sized for 3 A."
    (at 20.32 43.18 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "b6854b82-a51e-43aa-af62-b64b9b6bd3b7")
  )
  (text "Mounting holes, M3:"
    (at 20.32 163.83 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "4d2a0192-c75c-42ca-876f-67815edcac5c")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "1")
    )
  )
)
